       CBL INITCHECK(LAX)
      * THE SAME PROGRAM AS ZE149N UNDER INITCHECK(LAX): Z IS
      * INITIALIZED ON AT LEAST ONE PATH TO THE DISPLAY STATEMENT, SO NO
      * WARNING (RETURN CODE 0).
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ZE149P.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  Y PIC 9 VALUE 3.
       01  Z PIC 9.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           IF Y > 5
               MOVE 2 TO Z
           END-IF.
           DISPLAY Z.
           STOP RUN.
       END PROGRAM ZE149P.
